Package: plank-tablet-relay-ble
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-dbus, python3-gi, bluez, avahi-daemon, systemd, udev, kmod, usb-modeswitch, usb-modeswitch-data, iproute2, nftables, device-tree-compiler, mount
Description: Network and Bluetooth tablet relay for PLANK Tablet Setup
 Receives Wacom tablet input through Linux input devices and provides
 tablet enrollment and authenticated readings over TCP and Bluetooth LE.
 Advertises the active network service automatically through Avahi.
 Includes a managed system service and persistent headset trust. This setup
 component is separate from the raw-HID workstation forwarding service.
